Package: memreduct
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: monitor and reclaim Linux memory caches (Mem Reduct port)
 Rust CLI port of Henry++ Mem Reduct. Reads /proc and sysfs, drives
 drop_caches, registers PSI triggers, manages cgroup v2 memory limits,
 and reports zram telemetry. Every subcommand supports --json output.
